# Animated Image Gallery

An elegant and responsive animated image gallery built using **HTML** and **CSS**.  
The gallery expands images smoothly on hover, creating an interactive and modern user experience.

## 📌 Features

- Smooth hover animation effect
- Responsive flexbox layout
- Modern UI design
- Active image highlight
- Pure HTML & CSS (No JavaScript)


## 📂 Project Structure

```bash
project-folder/
│
├── index.html
├── style.css
└── README.md
```

## 🚀 Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- Flexbox
- CSS Transitions

## 📸 Preview

The gallery displays multiple images in a horizontal layout.  
When the user hovers over an image:

- The hovered image expands
- Other images shrink smoothly
- Creates an animated gallery effect

## 🎨 CSS Effects Used

### Flexbox Layout

```css
display: flex;
```

### Smooth Animation

```css
transition: .5s;
```

### Hover Expansion

```css
.image-box:hover{
    flex-basis: 25%;
}
```

## 📱 Responsive Design

The gallery uses flexible sizing with:

- `flex-grow`
- `flex-basis`
- `object-fit: cover`

This helps images adapt properly to different screen sizes.

